# Copy to apps/api/.dev.vars (gitignored). Every key is optional locally.
# The site's own address. Locally http://localhost:5183. In production set it as a Worker variable.
PUBLIC_URL=
# The passkey that unlocks /admin (and the Bearer key for scripts/videos.mjs). In production set it with: pnpm cf:secret ADMIN_KEY
# Pick something you can type: four or more random words. Under 16 characters the admin shows a "short passkey" note.
ADMIN_KEY=dev-admin-key
# Legacy (v1.5): MEGA links, one per line, read only for a library entry whose key has not been moved into the library yet
# ("Move it into the library" in /admin). Delete the secret once that is done: wrangler secret delete MEGA_LINKS
# MEGA_LINKS=
# Tests only: a local MEGA mock (apps/api/test/mega/mock-mega.mjs). Honoured only as http://127.0.0.1:<port> or http://localhost:<port>.
# MEGA_API=
